{"id":"662717","name":"羊肚菌蒸排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662717/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"羊肚菌","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨切块。","img":"images/662717/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"羊肚菌清水洗净备用。","img":"images/662717/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"排骨清水浸泡出血水洗净。","img":"images/662717/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/662717/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓拌均匀后少许花生油。","img":"images/662717/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入羊肚菌。","img":"images/662717/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀后腌制入味备用。","img":"images/662717/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"腌入味的排骨摆放入碗里。","img":"images/662717/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"冷水上高压锅，大火压15分钟左右。","img":"images/662717/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅前少许葱花即可。","img":"images/662717/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662717/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662717/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}